Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.98,0:01:10.34,English,C01-03-en-10,0,0,0,,{\q2}army.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.40,English,C01-04-en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}First, keep three distinctions clear.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.95,Chinese,C01-04-zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}先抓住三组容易混淆的数。
