Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.65,0:01:23.14,Chinese,C01-04-zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}一的角色记录，也不自动等于补进了一名士兵。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.66,0:01:26.22,English,C01-04-en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}Movement locking is another distinction: after Stop is
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.14,0:01:26.38,Chinese,C01-04-zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}另一组是移动锁定：按停止以后，
