Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.84,0:02:06.74,Chinese,C01-05-zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}再看那段时间真正发生了哪一类结算。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.19,0:02:10.47,English,C01-05-en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}A net change between readings is reported as a net change first.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.74,0:02:10.41,Chinese,C01-05-zh-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}两端的净变化，先按净变化报告。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.58,English,C01-06-en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}A march has several kinds of timing.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.47,Chinese,C01-06-zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}行军还有几种时间。
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.47,0:02:18.99,Chinese,C01-06-zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}地图预览给计划，军队窗口给当前估计，当前首段有自己
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.58,0:02:17.79,English,C01-06-en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}The map preview gives a plan; the army window gives a current
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.79,0:02:21.79,English,C01-06-en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}estimate; the first leg has its own progress and remaining
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.99,0:02:24.28,Chinese,C01-06-zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}的进度和剩余时量；军队真正到达，又是后来的结果。
