Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.00,0:02:44.16,Chinese,C01-07-zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}整军直走，争取少做中途安排；分兵休整
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.11,0:02:48.34,English,C01-07-en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Splitting to rest takes time at separate stations and to regroup.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.16,0:02:48.32,Chinese,C01-07-zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}，要付出分开驻留和重新会合的时间；换
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.32,0:02:52.26,Chinese,C01-07-zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}路线，则要走完预先选好的中转路径。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.34,0:02:52.45,English,C01-07-en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}Rerouting requires completing the chosen sequence of waypoints.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.26,0:02:56.27,Chinese,C01-07-zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}比较这三种安排时，要从同一个普通存档出
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.45,0:02:55.32,English,C01-07-en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}To compare these plans, start from the same
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.52,English,C01-07-en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}normal save and head for the same
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.27,0:03:00.29,Chinese,C01-07-zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}发，前往同一个目的地，分别记录各自真实
