Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.03,0:03:08.82,English,C01-08-en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Before departure, establish what the army currently has.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.03,0:03:10.51,Chinese,C01-08-zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}出发前，先知道军队现在有什么；途中，再看地点和路
