Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.72,Chinese,C01-08-zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}我们从补给开始。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.48,0:03:21.40,English,C01-08-en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}We begin with supply: separate what the army carries, how
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.72,0:03:21.26,Chinese,C01-08-zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}先把军队带着多少物资、最多能带
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.79,Chinese,C01-08-zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}多少，与当地能支持多少兵分开。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.40,0:03:25.19,English,C01-08-en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}much it can carry, and how many troops the location can
