Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.74,0:03:29.22,English,C01-08-en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then we can discuss where to stop, when to move on,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.75,0:03:32.71,Chinese,C01-08-zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}续走，以及分兵是不是减轻了当地压力。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.22,0:03:32.77,English,C01-08-en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}and whether splitting really reduces local pressure.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.50,0:03:39.76,English,C02-01-en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Read the army's current and maximum strength, then expand each regiment.
