Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.56,0:03:40.61,Chinese,C02-01-zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}员人数，再展开到每个兵团。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.76,0:03:42.46,English,C02-01-en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Locate deficits by comparing current
